     C*
     C*================================================================
     C* DATSBR - Date check subrountine
     C*================================================================
     C     DATSBR        BEGSR
     C*
     C* THIS SUBROUTINE IS CALLED AFTER EVERY SEARCH TO PROPERLY
     C* FORMAT ALL DATES ON SCREEN
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     SCRXFD        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DATCHK
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         SCRXFD
     C*
     C                   ENDSR
     C*================================================================
     C* DLTPRE - Pre-processing before delete occurs
     C*================================================================
     C     DLTPRE        BEGSR
     C*
     C* DELETE THE FDCAP RECORD
     C*
     C     @@RRN3        CHAIN     PCA02                              99
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *OFF
     C                   DELETE    PCA02
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C*
     C* DELETE EOB CODES/NOTES FOR THE LINE ITEM
     C*
     C     DEKY          CHAIN     PDE01                              99
     C     *IN99         DOWEQ     *OFF
     C                   DELETE    PDE01
     C     DEKY          READE     PDE01                                  99
     C                   ENDDO                                                  *IN99 = *OFF
     C*
     C*
     C* DELETE THE DETAIL AMOUNT TRANS RECORDS FOR LINE ITEM
     C*
     C     DAKY          CHAIN     PDA01                              99
     C     *IN99         DOWEQ     *OFF
     C                   DELETE    PDA01
     C     DAKY          READE     PDA01                                  99
     C                   ENDDO
     C*
     C* DELETE ERROR MESSAGES FOR THE LINE ITEM
     C*
     C     MGKY          CHAIN     PMG01                              99
     C     *IN99         DOWEQ     *OFF
     C                   DELETE    PMG01
     C     MGKY          READE     PMG01                                  99
     C                   ENDDO                                                  *IN99 = *OFF
     C*
     C                   ENDSR
     C*================================================================
     C* DSPLYR - Processing after displaying information
     C*================================================================
     C     DSPLYR        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR
     C*================================================================
     C* CARERR - Date check subrountine
     C*================================================================
     C     CARERR        BEGSR
     C*
     C     CARTAG        TAG
     C*
     C     EORCN         IFEQ      0
     C                   SETON                                        19
     C                   SETOFF                                       20
     C                   Z-ADD     EOCRDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTMDYY
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         SCCRDT
     C                   Z-ADD     EOCSDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTMDYY
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         SCCSDT
     C                   EXFMT     SCR03
     C*
     C     *INKL         IFEQ      *OFF
     C*
     C* DATE CARR RCVD CONNOT BE BLANK
     C*
     C     SCCRDT        IFEQ      *ZEROS
     C                   SETON                                        9010
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* DATE RECIEVED MUST BE VALID
     C*
     C     SCCRDT        IFNE      *ZEROS
     C                   Z-ADD     SCCRDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DATCHK
     C     SRERR         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   SETON                                        9021
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         SCCRDT
     C                   Z-ADD     SCCRDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         HLCRDT
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SRERR = '1'
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCRRDT NE *ZEROS
     C*
     C* Received date cannot be less than DOI
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLCRDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLCRDT        ANDLT     EOACDT
     C                   SETON                                        9022
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C* Received date cannot be less than EOMB TO DATE
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLCRDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLCRDT        ANDLT     EOTODT
     C     EPEDI         IFEQ      'Y'
     C                   SETON                                        9023
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C* Received date cannot be greater than system date
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLCRDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLCRDT        ANDGT     HLSYDT
     C                   SETON                                        9025
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C*  IF ADJ STATE IS KY, SENT DT CANNOT BE BLANK
     C*
     C     EOAST         IFEQ      'KY'
     C     SCCSDT        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C                   SETON                                        9008
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* Received date cannot be greater than sent date
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     SCCRDT        IFNE      *ZEROS
     C     SCCSDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     SCCSDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         HLCSDT
     C*
     C     HLCSDT        IFGT      HLCRDT
     C                   SETON                                        9026
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  HLCRDT GT HLRSDT
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCCRDT NE *ZEROS
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     SCCSDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C                   Z-ADD     SCCSDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DATCHK
     C     SRERR         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   SETON                                        9027
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         SCCSDT
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     SCCSDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         HLCSDT
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SRERR = '1'
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C* Sent date cannot be less than DOI
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLCSDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLCSDT        ANDLT     EOACDT
     C                   SETON                                        9013
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C* Sent date cannot be less than EOMB TO DATE
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLCSDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLCSDT        ANDLT     EOTODT
     C     EPEDI         IFEQ      'Y'
     C                   SETON                                        9012
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C* Sent date cannot be greater than system date
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLCSDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLCSDT        ANDGT     HLSYDT
     C                   SETON                                        9011
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C     @@RRN2        CHAIN     PEO01                              99
     C                   MOVE      SCCRDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         EOCRDT
     C                   Z-ADD     SCCSDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         EOCSDT
     C*
     C                   UPDATE    PEO01
     C*
     C                   ELSE                                                   *INKL=OFF
     C*
     C                   SETON                                        90
     C                   GOTO      CAREND
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *INKL=*OFF
     C*
     C                   ELSE                                                   RCN=0
     C*
     C                   SETON                                        20
     C                   SETOFF                                       19
     C                   Z-ADD     ESRRDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTMDYY
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         SCRRDT
     C                   Z-ADD     ESRSDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTMDYY
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         SCRSDT
     C                   EXFMT     SCR03
     C*
     C     *INKL         IFEQ      *OFF
     C*
     C*  CARR RCVD DT CANNOT BE BLANK
     C*
     C     SCRRDT        IFEQ      *ZEROS
     C                   SETON                                        9010
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* DATE RECIEVED MUST BE VALID
     C*
     C     SCRRDT        IFNE      *ZEROS
     C                   Z-ADD     SCRRDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DATCHK
     C     SRERR         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   SETON                                        9021
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         SCRRDT
     C                   Z-ADD     SCRRDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         HLRRDT
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SRERR = '1'
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCRRDT NE *ZEROS
     C*
     C* Received date cannot be less than DOI
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLRRDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLRRDT        ANDLT     EOACDT
     C                   SETON                                        9022
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C* Received date cannot be less than EOMB TO DATE
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLRRDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLRRDT        ANDLT     EOTODT
     C     EPEDI         IFEQ      'Y'
     C                   SETON                                        9023
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C* Received date cannot be greater than system date
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLRRDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLRRDT        ANDGT     HLSYDT
     C                   SETON                                        9025
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C*  IF ADJ STATE IS KY, SENT DT CANNOT BE BLANK
     C*
     C     EOAST         IFEQ      'KY'
     C     SCCSDT        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C                   SETON                                        9008
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* Received date cannot be greater than sent date
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     SCRRDT        IFNE      *ZEROS
     C     SCRSDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     SCRSDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         HLRSDT
     C*
     C     HLRSDT        IFGT      HLRRDT
     C                   SETON                                        9026
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  HLCRDT GT HLRSDT
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCCRDT NE *ZEROS
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     SCRSDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C                   Z-ADD     SCRSDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DATCHK
     C     SRERR         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   SETON                                        9027
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         SCCSDT
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     SCRSDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         HLRSDT
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SRERR = '1'
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C* Sent date cannot be less than DOI
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLRSDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLRSDT        ANDLT     EOACDT
     C                   SETON                                        9013
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C* Sent date cannot be less than EOMB TO DATE
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLRSDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLRSDT        ANDLT     EOTODT
     C     EPEDI         IFEQ      'Y'
     C                   SETON                                        9012
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C* Sent date cannot be greater than system date
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLRSDT        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     HLRSDT        ANDGT     HLSYDT
     C                   SETON                                        9011
     C                   GOTO      CARTAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90 = *OFF
     C*
     C     ESKY1         SETGT     PES01
     C     ESKY2         READPE    PES01                                  60
     C                   MOVE      SCRRDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         ESRRDT
     C                   MOVE      SCRSDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         ESRSDT
     C*
     C                   UPDATE    PES01
     C*
     C                   ELSE                                                   *INKL=OFF
     C*
     C                   SETON                                        90
     C                   GOTO      CAREND
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *INKL=*OFF
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  RCN=0
     C*
     C     CAREND        ENDSR
     C*================================================================
     C*  EDIERR - EDI ERROR SR FOR FUTURE DATES
     C*================================================================
     C     EDIERR        BEGSR
     C*
     C     EDITAG        TAG
     C*
     C                   MOVEL     EPEDI         SCEDI
     C                   EXFMT     SCR02
     C*
     C     *INKL         IFEQ      *OFF
     C*
     C     SCEDI         IFEQ      *BLANKS
     C                   SETON                                        9017
     C                   GOTO      EDITAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCEDI IFEQ BLANKS
     C*
     C     SCEDI         IFNE      *BLANKS
     C     SCEDI         ANDNE     'Y'
     C     SCEDI         ANDNE     'N'
     C                   SETON                                        9018
     C                   GOTO      EDITAG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCEDI IFNE BLANKS
     C*
     C     *IN90         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     EPKY          CHAIN     PEP01                              60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      *OFF
     C                   MOVEL     SCEDI         EPEDI
     C                   UPDATE    PEP01
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN60=*OFF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN90=*OFF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *INKL=*OFF
     C*
     C     EDIEND        ENDSR
     C*================================================================
     C* ERRCK1 - Error checking for srceen 1 (SCR01)
     C*================================================================
     C     ERRCK1        BEGSR
     C*
     C                   TIME                    DSDTTM
     C                   Z-ADD     DSDATE        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         HLSYDT
     C*
     C* Validate Claim Status (Adjudication) code
     C*
     C     SCCSCD        IFEQ      *BLANKS
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   SETON                                        9071
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCCSCD IFEQ BLANKS
     C*
     C                   MOVEL(P)  SCCSCD        KKKEY
     C     TBKY          CHAIN     PCS01                              99
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *ON
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   SETON                                        9072
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN99 IFEQ *ON
     C*
     C* Validate Date of Service
     C*
     C     SCRXFD        IFEQ      *ZEROS
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   SETON                                        9073
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCRXFD IFEQ ZEROS
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     SCRXFD        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DATCHK
     C     SRERR         IFEQ      '1'
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   SETON                                        9074
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         SCRXFD
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* DATE OF SERVICE CANNOT BE LESS THAN ACCIDENT DATE
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     SCRXFD        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         HLFDAT
     C*
     C     HLFDAT        IFLT      EOACDT
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   SETON                                        9075
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  HLFDAT IFLT HLACDT
     C*
     C* BASE THE EDIT OF PREVENTING FUTURE SERVICE DATES ON CONTROL
     C* FLAG SFBPF/FBAL04 POSTION 8 (BLANK = EDIT, Y = ALLOW FUTURE DATES)
     C*
     C     ##SDTS        IFNE      'Y'
     C*
     C     HLFDAT        IFGT      HLSYDT
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   SETON                                        9089
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  HLFDAT GT HLSYDT
     C*
     C*  Give an error window if the date is a future date and the
     C*  data submission flag is 'Y'.
     C*
     C                   ELSE                                                   XXFSDF='Y'
     C     EPEDI         IFEQ      'Y'
     C     HLFDAT        ANDGT     HLSYDT
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   EXSR      EDIERR
     C                   SETON                                        90
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  XXFSDF = *BLANKS
     C*
     C* Date of Service must be less than Carr Rcvd Dt
     C*     (If recon = 0)  FAEOP
     C*
     C* This is all conditioned on weather or not the EDI flag is on
     C*
     C     EORCN         IFEQ      0
     C     HLFDAT        ANDGT     EOCRDT
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   EXSR      CARERR
     C     EPEDI         IFEQ      'Y'
     C                   SETON                                        90
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  EORCN=0
     C*
     C*     (If recon > 0)  FAESP
     C*
     C     EORCN         IFGT      0
     C                   MOVEL     'R'           KKBLST
     C     ESKY1         SETGT     PES01
     C     ESKY2         READPE    PES01                                  60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLFDAT        IFGT      ESRRDT
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   EXSR      CARERR
     C     EPEDI         IFEQ      'Y'
     C                   SETON                                        90
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ELSE                                                   *IN60
     C     EORCN         SUB       1             KKRCN
     C     ESKY1         SETGT     PES01
     C     ESKY2         READPE    PES01                                  60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     HLFDAT        ANDGT     ESRRDT
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   EXSR      CARERR
     C     EPEDI         IFEQ      'Y'
     C                   SETON                                        90
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN60=*OFF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN60=*OFF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  EORCN>0
     C                   MOVEL     *BLANKS       SCZIPA
     C                   MOVEL     *BLANKS       SCZIPB
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        HLEFDT
     C*
     C* Let's get the zip area forn this line.
     C*
     C     P1KY          CHAIN     PP101                              99
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *OFF
     C                   MOVEL(P)  P1ZIP         KKFRZP
     C*
     C     GZKY1         SETGT     PGZ01
     C     GZKY2         READPE    PGZ01                                  99
     C     *IN99         DOWEQ     *OFF
     C     GZSTAT        IFNE      'I'
     C     KKFRZP        ANDLE     GZTOZP
     C     HLEFDT        IFEQ      *ZEROS
     C     GZEFDT        ORGT      HLEFDT
     C     GZEFDT        ANDLE     HLFDAT
     C                   MOVEL     GZZIPA        SCZIPA
     C                   MOVEL     GZZIPA        SCZIPB
     C                   Z-ADD     GZEFDT        HLEFDT
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ENDIF
     C     GZKY2         READPE    PGZ01                                  99
     C                   ENDDO
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* VALIDATE NDC DRUG CODE (REQUIRED)
     C*
     C     SCNDC         IFEQ      *BLANKS
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   SETON                                        9083
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCNDC  IFEQ BLANKS
     C*
     C                   MOVEL(P)  SCNDC         KKNDC
     C     RXKY          CHAIN     PRX01                              99
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *ON
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   SETON                                        9084
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN99 IFEQ *ON
     C*
     C     RXSTAT        IFEQ      'I'
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   SETON                                        9076
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  RXSTAT = 'I'
     C*
     C* VERIFY THAT FEE SCHEDULE IS ON SYSTEM FOR SERVICE DATE
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     HLFDAT        KKEFDT
     C                   MOVE      SCAST         KKST
     C                   MOVE      'X'           KKATYP
     C     RUKY1         SETGT     PRU01
     C     RUKY2         READPE    PRU01                                  99
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *ON
     C     *IN46         ANDEQ     *OFF
     C                   SETON                                        9082
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* CHARGES ARE REQUIRED
     C*
     C*
     C* IF ADJUDICATION CODE IS OVERRIDE TYPE, ALLOW ZERO CHARGE AMOUNT
     C*
     C     CSOVRD        IFNE      'Y'
     C     SCCHRG        IFEQ      *ZEROS
     C                   SETON                                        9077
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCCHRG IFEQ ZEROS
     C                   ENDIF                                                  CSOBRD NE Y
     C*
     C* TYPE CODE #1 REQUIRED IF CORRESPONDING AMOUNT IS ENTERED
     C*
     C     SCOTHR        IFNE      *ZEROS
     C     SCOT1C        ANDEQ     *BLANKS
     C                   SETON                                        9078
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCOTHER IFN *ZEROS
     C*
     C* VALIDATE TYPE CODE #1
     C*
     C     SCOT1C        IFNE      *BLANKS
     C                   MOVE      'O'           KKTYPE
     C                   MOVEL(P)  SCOT1C        KKCODE
     C     BSKY          CHAIN     PBS01                              99
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *ON
     C                   SETON                                        9079
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN99 IFEQ *ON
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCOT1C IFNE *BLANKS
     C*
     C* TYPE CODE #2 REQUIRED IF CORRESPONDING AMOUNT IS ENTERED
     C*
     C     SCOTH2        IFNE      *ZEROS
     C     SCOT2C        ANDEQ     *BLANKS
     C                   SETON                                        9080
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCOTHER IFN *ZEROS
     C*
     C* VALIDATE TYPE CODE #2
     C*
     C     SCOT2C        IFNE      *BLANKS
     C                   MOVE      'O'           KKTYPE
     C                   MOVEL(P)  SCOT2C        KKCODE
     C     BSKY          CHAIN     PBS01                              99
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *ON
     C                   SETON                                        9081
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN99 IFEQ *ON
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCOT2C IFNE *BLANKS
     C*
     C* CROSS-FOOT IF ADJUDICATION CODE IS OVERRIDE TYPE AND HAS
     C* NO OVERRIDE PRECENTAGE
     C*
     C                   MOVEL(P)  SCCSCD        KKKEY
     C     TBKY          CHAIN     PCS01                              99
     C*
     C* IF THE SUM OF THE REDUCTIONS AND PAID IS GREATER THAN THE
     C* CHARGED AMOUNT, THEN GIVE AN ERROR
     C*
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     CSOVRD        ANDEQ     'Y'
     C     CSOVRP        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCCHRG        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     SCMRA         ADD       SCOTHR        XXTOTL
     C                   ADD       SCOTH2        XXTOTL
     C   47              ADD       SCNTWK        XXTOTL
     C                   ADD       SCPAID        XXTOTL
     C     XXTOTL        IFGT      SCCHRG
     C                   SETON                                        9058
     C                   GOTO      CK1END
     C                   ENDIF                                                  XXTOTL GT SCCHRG
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN99 = *OFF
     C*
     C* SCENARIO #1
     C*
     C* MOVE CHARGE AMOUNT INTO MRA AMOUNT IF ALL REDUCTIONS ARE
     C* *ZERO AND PAID AMOUNT IS ZERO
     C*
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     CSOVRD        ANDEQ     'Y'
     C     CSOVRP        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCCHRG        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     SCMRA         ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCOTHR        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCOTH2        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCNTWK        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCPAID        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCCSCD        ANDNE     '300'
     C                   Z-ADD     SCCHRG        SCMRA
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN99 = *OFF
     C*
     C* SCENARIO #2
     C*
     C* IF CHARGE AMOUNT IS NOT ZERO, PAID AMOUNT IS NOT ZERO
     C* AND ALL REDUCTIONS AMOUNTS ARE ZERO, THEN PUT DIFFERENCE
     C* BETWEEN CHARGE AMOUNT AND PAID AMOUNT IN MRA REDUCTIONS
     C*
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     CSOVRD        ANDEQ     'Y'
     C     CSOVRP        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCCHRG        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     SCPAID        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     SCMRA         ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCOTHR        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCOTH2        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCNTWK        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCCHRG        SUB       SCPAID        SCMRA
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN99 = *OFF
     C*
     C* THE FOLLOWING MATH WILL CALCULATE THE PAID AMOUNT
     C* BASED ON THE CHARGED AMOUNT AND REDUCTION AMOUNTS ENTERED
     C* THIS WILL NOT CAUSE PROBLEMS WITH SCENARIOS #1 AND #2
     C*
     C     SCCHRG        IFNE      *ZEROS
     C     SCCSCD        ANDNE     '300'
     C     SCCHRG        SUB       SCMRA         SCPAID
     C                   SUB       SCOTHR        SCPAID
     C                   SUB       SCOTH2        SCPAID
     C                   SUB       SCNTWK        SCPAID
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCCHRG NE *ZEROS
     C* ZZZ
     C* SPECIAL CASE OF MFS = 'Y' FOR '300
     C*
     C     SCCHRG        IFNE      *ZEROS
     C     SCCSCD        ANDEQ     '300'
     C*
     C     SCMRA         IFNE      *ZEROS
     C     SCOTHR        ORNE      *ZEROS
     C     SCOTH2        ORNE      *ZEROS
     C     SCNTWK        ORNE      *ZEROS
     C*
     C     SCCHRG        SUB       SCMRA         SCPAID
     C                   SUB       SCOTHR        SCPAID
     C                   SUB       SCOTH2        SCPAID
     C                   SUB       SCNTWK        SCPAID
     C*
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* IF OVERIDE TYPE AND CHARGE IS ZEROS AND PAID NE ZEROS, THEN
     C* PUT THE DIFFERENCE IN SCMRA
     C*
     C     SCCHRG        IFEQ      *ZEROS
     C     CSOVRD        ANDEQ     'Y'
     C     SCPAID        ANDNE     *ZEROS
     C     SCCHRG        SUB       SCPAID        SCMRA
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SCOTHR
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SCOTH2
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SCNTWK
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCCHRG NE *ZEROS
     C*
     C     SCCHRG        IFEQ      *ZEROS
     C     CSOVRD        ANDEQ     'Y'
     C     SCPAID        ANDEQ     *ZEROS
     C     SCCHRG        SUB       SCMRA         SCPAID
     C                   SUB       SCOTHR        SCPAID
     C                   SUB       SCOTH2        SCPAID
     C                   SUB       SCNTWK        SCPAID
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SCCHRG = *ZEROS
     C*
     C* IF ADJUDICATION CODE IS AN OVERRIDE TYPE AND THE OVERRIDE
     C* PRECENTAGE IS GREATER THAN ZEROS, CLEAR ALL REDUCTIONS AMOUNT
     C* FIELDS AND PAID AMONTE FIELD.  THE ADJUDICATION PROGRAM
     C* REQUIRES THIS AMOUNTS TO BE ZEROS IN ORDER TO CALCULATE
     C* THE PERCENTAGE
     C*
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     CSOVRD        ANDEQ     'Y'
     C     CSOVRP        ANDGT     *ZEROS
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SCMRA
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SCOTHR
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SCOTH2
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SCNTWK
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SCPAID
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN99 = *OFF
     C*
     C* GIVE ERROR IF THE ADJUDICATION CODE IS AN OVERRIDE TYPE,
     C* OVERRIDE PERCENT IS ZERO, A REDUCTION IS APPLIED AND
     C* NO EOB CODE EXISTS FOR THE LINE ITEM
     C*
     C*
     C* 03/30/99 -  CALL EOB CODES/NOTES PROGRAM NOW INSTEAD OF GIVING
     C*             AN ERROR
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       XXEOB
     C     *IN99         IFEQ      *OFF
     C     CSOVRD        ANDEQ     'Y'
     C     CSOVRP        ANDLT     100
     C*
     C                   MOVEL(P)  '*YES'        GO                4
     C                   Z-ADD     EORCN         KKRCN
     C                   Z-ADD     SCSEQ#        KKDSEQ
     C     DEKY2         CHAIN     PDE03                              99
     C     *IN99         DOWEQ     *OFF
     C*
     C     DEESRC        IFEQ      'U'
     C                   MOVEL     *BLANKS       GO
     C                   LEAVE
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C     DEKY2         READE     PDE03                                  99
     C                   ENDDO
     C*
     C     GO            IFEQ      '*YES'
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     @@RRN2        ##RRN2
     C                   Z-ADD     @@RRN3        ##RRN3
     C*
     C* IF IN ADD MODE, NEED TO SEND IN SCREEN DSEQ NUMBER TO BE
     C* WRITTEN IN EOB CODES/NOTES FILE.  THIS IS DONE BECAUSE THIS
     C* DETAIL CHARGE IS NOT WRITTEN YET. ALSE SEND ZERO FOR THE
     C* RELATIVE RECORD NUMBER OF FDCAP (##RRN3).
     C*
     C     @@MODE        IFEQ      'A'
     C                   Z-ADD     SCSEQ#        ##DSEQ            5 0
     C                   Z-ADD     0             ##RRN3
