     C     DERCN         IFEQ      EORCN
     C                   DELETE    PDE01
     C                   ELSE
     C                   EXCEPT    RPDE01
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   ELSE
     C                   EXCEPT    RPDE01
     C                   ENDIF                                                  DEESRC = 'A'
     C     DEKY          READE     PDE01                                  99
